    // Evidence-Based Recovery: Disaster Cooperation Tracking (Oct 17, 2025)
    // Research: Wei et al. (2025), Drury et al. (2019), Zaki & Cikara (2020)
    // Tracks acute disaster phase (0-24 months) for cooperation boost
