 * 
 * Research-backed solution to meaning crisis in post-work society.
 * Based on McKinsey, Roosevelt Institute, Finland trials (2017-2018),
 * Alaska Permanent Fund (40+ years), Danaher (2019) "Automation and Utopia"
 * 
